    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 7.54,
      "end_time_s": 12.12,
      "duration_s": 4.58,
      "text": "Merci, Madame. Pourriez-vous préciser votre objection ?",
      "speaker_position": [
        6.87,
        2.29,
        1.67
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 12.29,
      "end_time_s": 19.03,
      "duration_s": 6.74,
      "text": "J'ai remarqué que vous avez utilisé des modèles prédictifs basés sur des séries temporelles, mais avez-vous tenu compte des anomalies ?",
      "speaker_position": [
        4.87,
        4.77,
        1.17
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.37
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 19.46,
      "end_time_s": 25.27,
      "duration_s": 5.8,
      "text": "Exactement. Vos résultats semblent trop lisses, comme si vous aviez filtré les « fastballs » de vos données brutes.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.01,
        6.18,
        1.19
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.24
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 25.73,
      "end_time_s": 31.44,
      "duration_s": 5.71,
      "text": "C'est vrai. Nous avons exclu les valeurs aberrantes pour mieux visualiser la tendance centrale.",
      "speaker_position": [
        6.87,
        2.29,
        1.67
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 32.03,
      "end_time_s": 37.55,
      "duration_s": 5.52,
      "text": "Mais cela compromet-il la robustesse de votre modèle ? Un audit approfondi révélerait-il ces écarts ?",
      "speaker_position": [
        4.87,
        4.77,
        1.17
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.37
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 38.09,
      "end_time_s": 43.06,
      "duration_s": 4.97,
      "text": "Je pense que oui. Vos graphiques montrent une convergence parfaite, ce qui est rare dans la pratique.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.01,
        6.18,
        1.19
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.24
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 43.5,
      "end_time_s": 48.91,
      "duration_s": 5.41,
      "text": "Nous avons utilisé un algorithme de régularisation pour lisser les pics.",
      "speaker_position": [
        6.87,
        2.29,
        1.67
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 49.19,
      "end_time_s": 53.43,
      "duration_s": 4.24,
      "text": "Et si un de ces pics était le signal le plus important ? Avez-vous vérifié cela ?",
      "speaker_position": [
        4.87,
        4.77,
        1.17
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.37
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 53.7,
      "end_time_s": 58.31,
      "duration_s": 4.61,
      "text": "C'est une excellente question. Je suppose que vous avez réalisé un audit de sensibilité ?",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.01,
        6.18,
        1.19
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.24
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 58.67,
      "end_time_s": 63.89,
      "duration_s": 5.22,
      "text": "Oui, mais les résultats sont présentés en annexe, peut-être trop succinctement.",
      "speaker_position": [
        6.87,
        2.29,
        1.67
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 64.04,
      "end_time_s": 69.18,
      "duration_s": 5.14,
      "text": "L'annexe B manque de détails. Sans cela, comment peut-on valider votre conclusion principale ?",
      "speaker_position": [
        4.87,
        4.77,
        1.17
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.37
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 69.76,
      "end_time_s": 73.85,
      "duration_s": 4.09,
      "text": "Je dirais que votre argumentation tient la route, mais les preuves sont fragiles.",
